# BgTTS-38M-V2 runs in its own venv (.venv-bgtts): MioCodec needs torchaudio, whose last release
# (2.9.1) predates the main env's torch 2.13. CPU-only, so the torch pin is independent.
# MioCodec itself is installed by setup.sh with --no-deps from MIOCODEC_REF: its pyproject points
# torch at the CUDA index, which made this lock ask for torch+cu128 on a Mac. Its dependencies:
huggingface-hub==2.1.1
jsonargparse[signatures]
json5
ruamel.yaml
einops
julius
safetensors
soundfile==0.14.0
numpy==2.5.3
torch==2.9.1
torchaudio==2.9.1
